5 2 10l10 5 10-5z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12v5c3 2 9 2 12 0v-5\"></path></svg></span>Admission<small>Requirements</small></a><a href=\"https://admission.mbzuh.ac.ae\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M16 13H8M16 17H8\"></path></svg></span>Apply<small>Admission portal</small></a><a href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V3H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 5.5z\"></path><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 6.5 22H20v-5\"></path></svg></span>Publications<small>Books &amp; journals</small></a><a href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/continuous-education.html\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6M4 14l6-6 2-3M2 5h12M7 2h1M22 22l-5-10-5 10M14 18h6\"></path></svg></span>Continuing education<small>Training &amp; language courses</small></a><a href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/news.html\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 22h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-2 2zm0 0a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-9c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 14h-8M15 18h-5M10 6h8v4h-8z\"></path></svg></span>News<small>Latest events</small></a><a href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/contact.html\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z\"></path></svg></span>Contact<small>Campuses &amp; hours</small></a></div></div>"}, {"id": "about", "cls": "sec sec-alt", "tag": "section", "kicker": "About Our University", "title": "About", "lead": "", "actions": [{"href": "/mbzuhweb/v12/about.html", "t": "Learn more about us"}], "html": "<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"bento\"><div class=\"card span4\"><p class=\"quote\" style=\"margin:0\">Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities is one of Abu Dhabi's premier state universities offering a wide range of academic programs in the humanities, social sciences, and philosophy. We are proud to promote Islamic and Arabic culture in its modernized form in alignment with our core values which constitute respect for human rights, harmony, and moderation. We offer graduate and postgraduate degrees in Islamic Studies and Arabic Language and Literature. We help our students to become globally aware, and to have a positive impact in the world. The university's main campus is in Abu Dhabi with a satellite campus in Ajman, Al Dhafra Branch.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card span2\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2c3b35,#14201c);color:#f3ecdf;border:0\"><span class=\"kicker\" style=\"color:#f0c886\">Our Mission</span><p style=\"color:#e6dece;margin:0\">We contribute to building a sustainable humanistic knowledge future within an advanced educational and research environment that establishes human values, strengthens national identity, and develops intellectual and religious competencies capable of innovation and global leadership.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card span3\"><b style=\"font-size:2.4rem;color:var(--lg-gold);line-height:1\">17</b><p style=\"margin:.3rem 0 0\">Programs Offered</p></div><div class=\"card span3\"><b style=\"font-size:2.4rem;color:var(--lg-gold);line-height:1\">3</b><p style=\"margin:.3rem 0 0\">Campus Locations</p></div>\n<div class=\"card span2 hoverable\"><span class=\"ico sage\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8l1 1.1L12 21l7.8-7.6 1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.7z\"></path></svg></span><h3>Zayed's Legacy</h3><p>Preserving Sheikh Zayed's legacy and drawing lessons and wisdom from it.</p></div><div class=\"card span2 hoverable\"><span class=\"ico sage\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 0 1 0 20 15 15 0 0 1 0-20z\"></path></svg></span><h3>Tolerance &amp; Coexistence</h3><p>Making the values of tolerance a practical standard for academic content and students, respecting diversity and difference, spreading peace, and rooting intellectual moderation in educational curricula.</p></div><div class=\"card span2 hoverable\"><span class=\"ico sage\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Human Fraternity</h3><p>Consolidating human fraternity and the principles of coexistence between peoples and cultures, and sensing their civilizational depth and importance.</p></div>\n</div></div>"}, {"id": "welcome", "cls": "sec", "tag": "section", "kicker": "Leadership", "title": "Welcome Statements", "lead": "Welcome messages from the university leadership — together we aspire to achieve academic excellence and leadership in the humanities", "actions": [], "html": "<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"grid g2\"><a class=\"card\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/welcome-chairman.html\"><div class=\"person\"><img alt=\"H.E. Dr. Omar Habtoor Al Darei\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"72\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/chairman-8172ce.webp\" width=\"72\"/><div><small>Chairman of the Board of Trustees</small><b>H.E. Dr. Omar Habtoor Al Darei</b></div></div><p class=\"quote\">“Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities stands as a leading institution of learning in the United Arab Emirates, a center of academic excellence, a hub of knowledge, and a research community with a global mission. It shapes the future while preserving the values and national identity.”</p><span class=\"more\">Read the full message ←</span></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/welcome-chancellor.html\"><div class=\"person\"><img alt=\"H.E. Dr. Khalifa Mubarak Al Dhaheri\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"72\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/chancellor-1f82f6.webp\" width=\"72\"/><div><small>Chancellor</small><b>H.E. Dr. Khalifa Mubarak Al Dhaheri</b></div></div><p class=\"quote\">“It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities, the first university in the United Arab Emirates to specialize in humanities studies. In just a short period of time, the university has established itself as a premier educational institution.”</p><span class=\"more\">Read the full message ←</span></a></div></div>"}, {"id": "colleges", "cls": "sec sec-alt", "tag": "section", "kicker": "Colleges", "title": "Academic Programs", "lead": "Discover our comprehensive range of undergraduate, diploma, master's, and doctoral programs designed to advance knowledge in humanities and Islamic studies.", "actions": [{"href": "/mbzuhweb/v12/programs.html", "t": "Program finder"}], "html": "<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"grid g4\"><a class=\"card media-card\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/colleges/islamic-studies.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"College of Islamic Studies\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/islamic-studies-490fc9.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><h3>College of Islamic Studies</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">The College of Islamic Studies at Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities (Abu Dhabi, UAE) is dedicated to achieving excellence in Islamic education while promoting the values of moderate Islam in line with the UAE's national vision. It offers a Bachelor's Program in Islamic Studies that blends deep traditional knowledge with modern curricula, humanities, and technology. The college aims to qualify graduates with strong ethical values, critical thinking skills, and readiness for the labor market and postgraduate research.</p><span class=\"more\">Explore the college ←</span></div></a><a class=\"card media-card\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/colleges/social-human-sciences.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"College of Social and Human Sciences\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/social-human-sciences-ad8f92.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><h3>College of Social and Human Sciences</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">The College of Social and Human Sciences at Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities strives for leadership and excellence in an educational environment built on moderation and tolerance. It offers programs including a Bachelor of Arts in Philosophy and Ethics and a Bachelor of Social Studies in Tolerance and Peace. The college equips students with high-quality knowledge and critical thinking skills, fosters national values and social responsibility, and prepares graduates for both the labor market and advanced academic research.</p><span class=\"more\">Explore the college ←</span></div></a><a class=\"card media-card\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/colleges/arts-languages.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"College of Arts &amp; Languages\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/arts-languages-9c2c45.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><h3>College of Arts &amp; Languages</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">The College of Arts &amp; Languages at Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities focuses on Arabic language, linguistics, literature, and cultural studies. It develops students’ communication, analytical, and research skills while promoting cultural awareness and engagement with human heritage.</p><span class=\"more\">Explore the college ←</span></div></a><a class=\"card media-card\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/colleges/graduate-studies.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"College of Graduate Studies and Research\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/graduate-studies-219df4.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><h3>College of Graduate Studies and Research</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">The College of Graduate Studies and Research at Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities offers advanced academic programs and promotes high-quality research in philosophy, religion, ethics, and humanities. It aims to develop critical thinking, innovation, and scholarly excellence while preparing students for academic, research, and professional careers</p><span class=\"more\">Explore the college ←</span></div></a></div>\n<div class=\"cta\" style=\"margin-top:2.5rem\"><div><h2>Ready to Begin Your Journey?</h2><p>Join the distinguished community of researchers at Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities.</p></div><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://admission.mbzuh.ac.ae\">Apply Now</a></div></div>"}, {"id": "publications", "cls": "sec", "tag": "section", "kicker": "Knowledge", "title": "Publications & Magazines", "lead": "Explore the latest scholarly publications and periodical journals from Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities", "actions": [{"href": "/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html", "t": "View all publications (32)"}], "html": "<div class=\"container\"><div aria-label=\"Publications &amp; Magazines\" class=\"shelf\" tabindex=\"0\"><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-the-national-school\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of The National School\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/1788764619452-01-school-799c22.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">The National School</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-guiding-the-seeker-to-the-principles-of-imam-malik\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of Guiding the Seeker to the Principles of Imam Malik\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/1787648266634-c47da0.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">Guiding the Seeker to the Principles of Imam Malik</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-altyarat-alirhayh-byn-wsmh-altarykh-walfkr-almlwth\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of التيارات الإرهاية بين وصمة التاريخ والفكر الملوث\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/cover-8361d4.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">التيارات الإرهاية بين وصمة التاريخ والفكر الملوث</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-major-religious-concepts-between-extremist-conceptions-and-m\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of Major Religious Concepts Between Extremist Conceptions and Moderate Understanding\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/major-religious-concepts-between-extremi-6eb490.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">Major Religious Concepts Between Extremist Conceptions and Moderate Understanding</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-foundations-of-faith-in-human-life\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of Foundations of Faith in Human Life\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/foundations-of-faith-in-human-life-cover-c2ea5f.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">Foundations of Faith in Human Life</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-an-introduction-to-islamic-knowledge-and-values\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of An Introduction to Islamic Knowledge and Values\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/an-introduction-to-islamic-knowledge-and-b92b2c.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">An Introduction to Islamic Knowledge and Values</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-the-legitimacy-and-sunnah-of-covering-in-prayer\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of The Legitimacy and Sunnah of Covering in Prayer\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/the-legitimacy-and-sunnah-of-covering-in-9b8e6c.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">The Legitimacy and Sunnah of Covering in Prayer</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-scientific-research-its-methods-and-approaches\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of Scientific Research: Its Methods and Approaches\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/scientific-research-its-methods-and-appr-87fc29.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">Scientific Research: Its Methods and Approaches</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-introduction-to-psychology\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of Introduction to Psychology\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/introduction-to-psychology-cover-2e7df3.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">Introduction to Psychology</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-the-rabbinic-torah\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of The Rabbinic Torah\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/the-rabbinic-torah-cover-8d2355.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">The Rabbinic Torah</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-quine-beyond-analytic-philosophy-semantics-and-philosophy-of\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of Quine: Beyond Analytic Philosophy – Semantics and Philosophy of Science\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/quine-beyond-analytic-philosophy-semanti-32ea8a.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">Quine: Beyond Analytic Philosophy – Semantics and Philosophy of Science</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-the-historical-roots-of-stoning-and-flogging-punishments\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of The Historical Roots of Stoning and Flogging Punishments\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/the-historical-roots-of-stoning-and-flog-b4c4fa.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">The Historical Roots of Stoning and Flogging Punishments</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-islamic-culture\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of Islamic Culture\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/islamic-culture-cover-ecdc57.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">Islamic Culture</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-the-great-values-part-one\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of The Great Values – Part One\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/the-great-values-part-one-cover-631154.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">The Great Values – Part One</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-the-great-values-part-two\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of The Great Values – Part Two\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/the-great-values-part-two-cover-e6ee99.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">The Great Values – Part Two</h3></a><a class=\"book\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/publications.html#b-the-five-universals-and-interfaith-dialogue-among-the-abraha\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover of The Five Universals and Interfaith Dialogue Among the Abrahamic Religions\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/the-five-universals-and-interfaith-dialo-8aa175.webp\"/></div><h3 class=\"clamp2 bk-t\">The Five Universals and Interfaith Dialogue Among the Abrahamic Religions</h3></a></div></div>"}, {"id": "accreditations", "cls": "sec sec-alt", "tag": "section", "kicker": "", "title": "Accreditations & Memberships", "lead": "", "actions": [], "html": "<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"logos\"><figure><img alt=\"CAA - Commission for Academic Accreditation\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/caa-a0648a.webp\"/><figcaption>CAA - Commission for Academic Accreditation</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"QAA - Quality Assurance Agency\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/qaa-167c9c.webp\"/><figcaption>QAA - Quality Assurance Agency</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"QS Stars Rating\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/qs-stars-ec97dc.webp\"/><figcaption>QS Stars Rating</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"FUIW - Federation of the Universities of the Islamic World\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/fuiw-93b802.webp\"/><figcaption>FUIW - Federation of the Universities of the Islamic World</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AARU - Association of Arab Universities\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/aaru-ecb76e.webp\"/><figcaption>AARU - Association of Arab Universities</figcaption></figure></div></div>"}, {"id": "news", "cls": "sec", "tag": "section", "kicker": "Media", "title": "Latest News & Events", "lead": "Stay updated with the latest developments, achievements, and events from Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities.", "actions": [{"href": "/mbzuhweb/v12/news.html", "t": "All news"}], "html": "<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"bento\"><div class=\"span3\"><a class=\"card media-card\" data-news=\"MBZUH concludes international conference in Italy with recommendations on AI, joint publication The First International Conference on Religious Studies, organised by Mohamed bin Zayed University for Humanities (MBZUH) in the Italian city of Padua, concluded with seven principal recommendations in its final statement, including launching a religious common ground project, expanding academic exchange and joint scholarly publication, and developing pathways for translating specialised research. Conference\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/news/cmuv3128m0000692ujy1nrce2.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"MBZUH concludes international conference in Italy with recommendations on AI, joint publication\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/1791194619904-news-4-oct-f3a2ce.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Conference</span><span>5 October 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"clamp3\" style=\"font-size:1.3rem\">MBZUH concludes international conference in Italy with recommendations on AI, joint publication</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">The First International Conference on Religious Studies, organised by Mohamed bin Zayed University for Humanities (MBZUH) in the Italian city of Padua, concluded with seven principal recommendations in its final statement, including launching a religious common ground project, expanding academic exchange and joint scholarly publication, and developing pathways for translating specialised research.</p></div></a></div><div class=\"span3\"><a class=\"card media-card\" data-news=\"‘Education in Service of Family’ conference concludes in Abu Dhabi The “Education in the Service of the Family: From Vision to Impact” conference concluded today in Abu Dhabi after three days of discussions on strengthening integration between families and educational institutions amid rapid social and technological change. Conference, University News\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/news/cmucjdeb2000069q7ey4sb780.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"‘Education in Service of Family’ conference concludes in Abu Dhabi\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/1790073211985-news-17-sep-2a06af.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Conference, University News</span><span>17 September 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"clamp3\" style=\"font-size:1.3rem\">‘Education in Service of Family’ conference concludes in Abu Dhabi</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">The “Education in the Service of the Family: From Vision to Impact” conference concluded today in Abu Dhabi after three days of discussions on strengthening integration between families and educational institutions amid rapid social and technological change.</p></div></a></div><div class=\"span2\"><a class=\"card media-card\" data-news=\"Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities Enriches Abu Dhabi International Book Fair with 115 Publications Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities is participating in the Abu Dhabi International Book Fair, an engagement that reflects the university's ongoing mission to support and advance cultural, scholarly, and academic life in Abu Dhabi and the United Arab Emirates, alongside its broader international presence. Exhibition\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/news/cmufcf1d1000069msf1tdit5b.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities Enriches Abu Dhabi International Book Fair with 115 Publications\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/1790243021032-screenshot-2026-09-24-1343-dafb2f.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Exhibition</span><span>13 September 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"clamp2\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem\">Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities Enriches Abu Dhabi International Book Fair with 115 Publications</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities is participating in the Abu Dhabi International Book Fair, an engagement that reflects the university's ongoing mission to support and advance cultural, scholarly, and academic life in Abu Dhabi and the United Arab Emirates, alongside its broader international presence.</p></div></a></div><div class=\"span2\"><a class=\"card media-card\" data-news='Mohamed bin Zayed University for Humanities to host ‘Education in the Service of the Family: From Vision to Impact’ Conference Mohamed bin Zayed University for Humanities will host the \"Education in the Service of the Family: From Vision to Impact\" Conference from 15th to 17th September 2026, under the patronage of H.H. Lt. General Sheikh Saif bin Zayed Al Nahyan, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of the Interior. The conference is organised in partnership with the Education Interface platform as part of its 2026 events. Conference, University News' href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/news/cmttyx772000369fs4cf50e9r.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"Mohamed bin Zayed University for Humanities to host ‘Education in the Service of the Family: From Vision to Impact’ Conference\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/1788950472787-news-8-sep-2026-e6e8fa.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Conference, University News</span><span>9 September 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"clamp2\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem\">Mohamed bin Zayed University for Humanities to host ‘Education in the Service of the Family: From Vision to Impact’ Conference</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">Mohamed bin Zayed University for Humanities will host the \"Education in the Service of the Family: From Vision to Impact\" Conference from 15th to 17th September 2026, under the patronage of H.H. Lt. General Sheikh Saif bin Zayed Al Nahyan, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of the Interior. The conference is organised in partnership with the Education Interface platform as part of its 2026 events.</p></div></a></div><div class=\"span2\"><a class=\"card media-card\" data-news=\"MBZUH presents UAE model of tolerance, coexistence, interfaith dialogue at New York Summit Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities (MBZUH) highlighted the UAE’s experience in promoting tolerance, coexistence and interfaith dialogue during the “One World: One Humanity Summit” in New York. University News\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/news/cmtqqid10000069997fgris1x.html\"><div class=\"thumb\"><img alt=\"MBZUH presents UAE model of tolerance, coexistence, interfaith dialogue at New York Summit\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/mbzuhweb/assets/img/o/1788754945051-news-4-sep-2026-b6f2c6.webp\"/></div><div class=\"body\"><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">University News</span><span>4 September 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"clamp2\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem\">MBZUH presents UAE model of tolerance, coexistence, interfaith dialogue at New York Summit</h3><p class=\"clamp3\">Mohamed Bin Zayed University for Humanities (MBZUH) highlighted the UAE’s experience in promoting tolerance, coexistence and interfaith dialogue during the “One World: One Humanity Summit” in New York.</p></div></a></div></div></div>"}, {"id": "campuses", "cls": "sec sec-alt", "tag": "section", "kicker": "Locations", "title": "Our campuses", "lead": "", "actions": [{"href": "/mbzuhweb/v12/contact.html", "t": "Contact us"}], "html": "<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"grid g3\"><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></span><h3>Main campus - Abu Dhabi</h3><p><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"tel:+97124999000\">+971 2 499 9000</a></p><a class=\"more ext\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=24.440738,54.405815\" rel=\"noop